0 18 334 [
[(If the objects receive a proper message \050like a float message for the)]
[(number box below\051, they get displayed and pass through. A "set" message)]
[(updates but doesn't output. A bang outputs its holding value. See the)]
[(Number atom box below:)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 46 126 [
[(The number atom box object toggles between 0 and a non zero value)]
[(If you click on a number box while pressing "control" \050in Linux or)]
[(Windows\051 or "command" \050Mac\051. The non zero value is the last non)]
[(zero value that the box holds \050by default, this value is "1"\051.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 776 346 [
[(lists starting with a symbol)]
[(must be preceded by the "list")]
[(selector to disambiguate them)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 18 381 [
[(You can also change a numeric value upward or downward by clicking and)]
[(dragging. Shift-click changes the value in hundredths instead of units.)]
[(This works for both number boxes and individual numbers in a list box.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 18 616 [
[(These GUI \050Graphical User Interface\051 objects display and send atoms or)]
[(lists. An atom is a single element message \050symbol or float\051. A list is)]
[(composed of more than one atom and can hold floats and/or symbols.)]
[(These objects may be created by selecting "number" \050etc.\051 from the)]
[("put" menu. The contents can be changed while the patch is in "run")]
[(mode \050as opposed to "edit" mode\051, so these are useful as controls and)]
[(displays in a finished patch.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 18 513 [
[(Clicking on the object activates it \050indicated via a thicker border\051.)]
[(Clicking outside the box deactivates it. When active, you can hit enter)]
[(to output the current value \050this can be done multiple times\051. You can)]
[(also type new values \050using backspace to correct typing is allowed\051 and)]
[(hit enter to validate and output them. You can cancel the typing action)]
[(by reclicking on the object \050to keep it activated\051 or outside it \050to)]
[(deactivate it\051. Double-clicking activates a text editor so that you can)]
[(navigate with arrows and use backspace/delete or click and drag to)]
[(select contents to cut/copy/paste \050then also hit enter when done\051.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
